      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "염기서열 분석 기반 SNP 검사가 왜 신뢰할 수 있나요?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "염기서열 분석은 유전자 뉴클레오티드 변이를 직접 분석하여 고도로 재현 가능하고 정밀한 분자 데이터를 제공합니다. 과학적 참고 문헌 Vignal, A., Milan, D., SanCristobal, M., & Eggen, A. (2002). A review on SNP and other types of molecular markers and their use in animal genetics. Genetics Selection Evolution , 34(3), 275–305. DOI: https://doi.org/10.1186/1297-9686-34-3-275 Morin, P. A., Luikart, G., & Wayne, R. K. (2004). SNPs in ecology, evolution and conservation. Trends in Ecology & Evolution , 19(4), 208–216. DOI: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tree.2004.01.009 Brumfield, R. T., Beerli, P., Nickerson, D. A., & Edwards, S. V. (2003). The utility of single nucleotide polymorphisms in inferences of population history. Trends in Ecology & Evolution , 18(5), 249–256. DOI: https://doi.org/10.1016/S0169-5347(03)00018-1 Butler, J. M. (2015). The future of forensic DNA analysis. Philosophical Transactions of the Royal Society B , 370(1674). DOI: https://doi.org/10.1098/rstb.2014.0252"
      }
    }
  ]
};
const hreflang = "<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en-US\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/pigeon-dna-fingerprinting/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/pigeon-dna-fingerprinting/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/ar/بصمات-الحمض-النووي-للحمام/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ja\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/ja/ハトのdna指紋/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ko-KR\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/ko/비둘기-dna-핑거프린팅/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ko\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/ko/비둘기-dna-핑거프린팅/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es-ES\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/es/huellas-de-adn-de-palomas/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/es/huellas-de-adn-de-palomas/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr-FR\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/fr/empreinte-genetique-des-pigeons/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/fr/empreinte-genetique-des-pigeons/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de-DE\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/de/tauben-dna-fingerprinting/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/de/tauben-dna-fingerprinting/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/pigeon-dna-fingerprinting/\" />";
